                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya ni yo mazina y’abahizi Dawidi yar’ afise: Yoshebu‐bashebeti w’i Takemoni, ni we yar’ umukuru wa bamwe batatu; ni we yarāgūriye icumu abantu amajana munani, bahindikiranirah’ umusi umwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.27.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ngo 27:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwa kabiri kuri we muri ba bahizi batatu ni Eleyazari mwene Dodayi Umwahohi. Yari kumwe na Dawidi igihe bahangāra Abafilisitiya bari bakoraniye kubarwanya. Maz’ Abisirayeli bahunze, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.11.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 11:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.19.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "19:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "arahaguruka yica Abafilisitiya, ukuboko kwiwe kurateba kugwa ikinyānya, kwumira ku nkota. Uwo musi Uhoraho atanga intsinzi ikomeye; abantu baraheza bagaruka kuri Eleyazari, bazanywe no gukoba imivyimba gusa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akurikirwa na Shama mwene Ageye Umuharari. Abafilisitiya bari bakoraniye i Lehi, ahār’ umurima w’inkore; nukw ingabo zihunga Abafilisitiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko we yihagararira muri wa murima, arawurwanira, yica Abafilisitiya; nuk’ Uhoraho atanga intsinzi ikomeye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
