              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi na Benaya mwene Yehoyada, umuntu w’umuhizi w’i Kabuseli, na we yari yarakoze ivy’ ubutōre; ni we yishe bene Ariyeli w’i Mowabu bompi; kandi yaramanutse yicira intambge mw isenga, ku musi shelegi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23:20",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "shelegi n’ikintu coroshe cera, gikoroka hasi nk’imvura, gikanye cane.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " yar’ iguye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yishe n’Umunyegiputa mwiza w’akaranga; uwo Munyegiputa yar’ afise icumu mu minwe, ariko we amanuka iy’ ari atwaye ubuhiri; amushikura iryo cumu, ararimwicisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ivyo ni vyo Benaya mwene Yehoyada yakoze, aronka izina rya rurangiranwa muri ba bahizi mirongwitatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaravugangwa mur’ abo mirongwitatu nyene, ariko ntiyashikīra ba bandi batatu ba mbere. Maze Dawidi amugira umukuru w’abashibamyi biwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
